stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_reserve_pot: judging_pot = contest_pot * 0.08
    q_reserve_pot --> q_judge_participates: judge votes on issues during real-time judging
    q_judge_participates --> q_dedicated_check: is judge a dedicated judge?
    q_dedicated_check --> q_dedicated: dedicated judge (5 slots public, 3 private)
    q_dedicated_check --> q_regular: regular community judge
    q_dedicated --> q_ded_complete_check: did judge review all issues?
    q_ded_complete_check --> q_ded_complete: all issues reviewed
    q_ded_complete_check --> q_ded_incomplete: not all issues reviewed
    q_ded_complete --> q_boost_500: reward boost = 500%
    q_ded_incomplete --> q_boost_100_penalty: reward boost = 100%, signal decreased 50%
    q_regular --> q_boost_100: reward boost = 100%
    q_boost_500 --> q_comment_check: did judge write top-signal comment?
    q_boost_100 --> q_comment_check: did judge write top-signal comment?
    q_boost_100_penalty --> q_comment_check: did judge write top-signal comment?
    q_comment_check --> q_comment_boost: top comment = additional 300% boost
    q_comment_check --> q_comment_penalty: non-top comment = 10% penalty
    q_comment_check --> q_no_comment: no comment written
    q_comment_boost --> q_calc_rewards: calculate total rewards and penalties
    q_comment_penalty --> q_calc_rewards: calculate total rewards and penalties
    q_no_comment --> q_calc_rewards: calculate total rewards and penalties
    q_calc_rewards --> q_net_points: net_points = sum(rewards) - sum(penalties)
    q_net_points --> q_positive: net_points > 0
    q_net_points --> q_negative: net_points <= 0
    q_positive --> q_share: judge_share = judge_net_points / sum(all_positive_net_points)
    q_share --> q_payout: judge_usdc = judge_share * judging_pot
    q_payout --> [*]: return judging payout
    q_negative --> [*]: no USDC payout (signal still decreased)

    note right of q_reserve_pot
        INV-001: Judging pot ~8% of audit contest pot
