    note right of q_dedicated
        INV-002: 5 dedicated judges for public contests, 3 for private
        INV-003: Dedicated judge must review 100 issues per day
        INV-004: Failure to complete = 100% boost only + 50% signal decrease
    end note

    note right of q_comment_check
        INV-005: Writing top-signal comment = 300% reward boost on that judgment
        INV-006: Non-top comment = 10% penalty
        INV-007: Only 1 comment per severity per judge allowed
        INV-008: Changing comment may incur penalty
    end note

    note right of q_calc_rewards
        INV-009: AMM logic determines reward/penalty per vote based on existing signal
        INV-010: Reward increases over time, decreases after others vote same outcome
        INV-011: Risk/reward ratio increases over time (late judging less penalizing)
    end note
